<title>USA: Trident Microsystems names Mangan CFO.</title>
<headline>Trident Microsystems names Mangan CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident Microsystems Inc said Friday it had named Pete Mangan as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Mangan, who joined Trident in November 1996 as corporate controller, has 13 years' experience in the high-technology industry with Advanced Micro Devices Inc and Sun Microsystems Inc.</p>
<p>Trident develops and markets graphics controllers and multimedia integrated circuits for personal computers.</p>
</text>
